    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Chapter 10  I  greedy algorithms\n192",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     33.697998046875,
     288.0104064941406,
     56.0
    ],
    "font": "MyriadPro-Bold",
    "size": 18.0,
    "color": 10690613,
    "text": "The classroom scheduling problem",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     67.12100219726562,
     261.91485595703125,
     94.9620132446289
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Suppose you have a classroom and want to hold as many  \nclasses here as possible. You get a list of classes.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     229.51800537109375,
     325.31536865234375,
     244.50001525878906
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "You can’t hold all of these classes in there because some of them overlap.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     386.8810119628906,
     320.32159423828125,
     427.7239685058594
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "You want to hold as many classes as possible in this classroom. How \ndo you pick what set of classes to hold so that you get the biggest set of \nclasses possible?",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     430.385986328125,
     317.7475280761719,
     458.2269592285156
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Sounds like a hard problem, right? Actually, the algorithm is so easy it \nmight surprise you. Here’s how it works:",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     460.88897705078125,
     320.5577697753906,
     488.7300109863281
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "1.\t Pick the class that ends the soonest. This is the first class you’ll hold \nin this classroom.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     491.3919982910156,
     295.8739318847656,
     532.2350463867188
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "2.\t Now, you have to pick a class that starts after the first class.  \nAgain, pick the class that ends the soonest. This is the second  \nclass you’ll hold.",
    "is_code": false
   }
  ],
  "images": [
   [
    116.27200317382812,
    109.70001220703125,
    218.75100708007812,
    215.54000854492188
   ],
   [
    41.03099822998047,
    259.2400207519531,
    293.99200439453125,
    372.760009765625
   ],
