    297.7799987792969,
    38.0,
    394.5,
    167.83999633789062
   ]
  ]
 },
 {
  "pdf_index": 218,
  "blocks": [
   {
    "bbox": [
     123.34500122070312,
     0.14801597595214844,
     432.5,
     11.166749954223633
    ],
    "font": "MyriadPro-It",
    "size": 9.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "The classroom scheduling problem\n193",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.5,
     35.11800765991211,
     337.9815979003906,
     62.959022521972656
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Keep doing this, and you’ll end up with the answer! Let’s try it out. Art \nends the soonest, at 10:00 a.m., so that’s one of the classes you pick.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.5,
     185.3380126953125,
     328.3456115722656,
     213.1790313720703
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Now you need the next class that starts after 10:00 a.m. and ends the \nsoonest.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.5,
     327.5580139160156,
     288.8445739746094,
     342.3970031738281
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "English is out because it conflicts with Art, but Math works.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.5,
     345.05902099609375,
     242.61257934570312,
     359.89801025390625
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Finally, CS conflicts with Math, but Music works.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.5,
     482.2790222167969,
     281.3975830078125,
     497.1180114746094
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "So these are the three classes you’ll hold in this classroom.",
    "is_code": false
   }
  ],
